This project was initially extracted from WisNodeZ Arduino prototype work and
renamed for the RTBus RTDuo package identity.

The public Arduino package identity is:

    rtbus:rtduo

Some internal runtime ABI symbols, enum names, and compatibility macros still
use WisNodeZ-derived names. These names are retained to avoid breaking the
runtime/application ABI during the initial extraction.

RAKWireless board names such as RAK4631, RAK3172, RAK11720, and RAK4200 refer
to the target hardware modules and boards. They do not imply that this package
is published by or officially supported by RAKWireless.
